query subheading is:
    the subheading of which good is which code.

query heading is:
    the heading of which good is which heading.

query unplaced is:
    which good is not placed by the model.

% BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2026-04256, French customs, 22/07/2026: men's high-visibility polo.
scenario bti_frbtifr_bti_2026_04256 is, as stated in BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2026-04256:
    the high visibility polo is an upper body garment,
        confer "Description of goods Vêtement pour homme de haute visibilité".
    the high visibility polo is classified under the EU tariff,
        confer "Issuing country FR".
    the fabric construction of the high visibility polo is knitted,
        confer "en bonneterie majoritairement de coton (55 % Coton".
    the cut of the high visibility polo indicates men,
        confer "Description of goods Vêtement pour homme de haute visibilité".
    the high visibility polo has a collar,
        confer "Il comporte un col chemisier en bord-côte de couleur contrastée".
    the high visibility polo has an opening starting at the neckline,
        confer "une ouverture partielle sur le devant se fermant gauche sur droite au moyen de trois boutons".
    the high visibility polo closes left over right,
        confer "une ouverture partielle sur le devant se fermant gauche sur droite au moyen de trois boutons".
    the high visibility polo contains 55 percent of cotton,
        confer "en bonneterie majoritairement de coton (55 % Coton".
    the high visibility polo contains 45 percent of polyester,
        confer "45 % Polyester)".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the high visibility polo is 6105.10"].

% BTI DEBTI22950/25-1, Hauptzollamt Hannover, 26/09/2025: men's knitted shirt.
scenario bti_debti22950_25_1 is, as stated in BTI DEBTI22950/25-1:
    the napped knitted shirt is an upper body garment,
        confer "Description of goods Hemd".
    the napped knitted shirt is classified under the EU tariff,
        confer "Issuing country DE".
    the fabric construction of the napped knitted shirt is knitted,
        confer "einfarbigen Gewirken aus laut Antrag 100 % Polyester (synthetische Chemiefasern)".
    the napped knitted shirt closes left over right,
        confer "vorn mit einer durchgehenden Öffnung mit Druckknopfverschluss von links auf rechts (Männerkleidung)".
    the napped knitted shirt is napped,
        confer "beidseitig gerauten".
    the napped knitted shirt has a collar,
        confer "mit einem doppelt gearbeiteten Umlegekragen".
    the napped knitted shirt has an opening starting at the neckline,
        confer "vorn mit einer durchgehenden Öffnung mit Druckknopfverschluss von links auf rechts (Männerkleidung)".
    the napped knitted shirt contains 100 percent of polyester,
        confer "Gewirken aus laut Antrag 100 % Polyester (synthetische Chemiefasern)".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the napped knitted shirt is 6105.20"].

% BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2026-01958, French customs, 20/05/2026: women's knitted shirt-blouse.
scenario bti_frbtifr_bti_2026_01958 is, as stated in BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2026-01958:
    the printed cotton shirt-blouse is an upper body garment,
        confer "Description of goods Vêtement destiné à couvrir le haut du corps".
    the printed cotton shirt-blouse is classified under the EU tariff,
        confer "Issuing country FR".
    the fabric construction of the printed cotton shirt-blouse is knitted,
        confer "confectionné en bonneterie de coton".
    the cut of the printed cotton shirt-blouse indicates women,
        confer "pour femme".
    the printed cotton shirt-blouse has an opening starting at the neckline,
        confer "d'un col rond avec une ouverture partielle en V au niveau du décolleté".
    the printed cotton shirt-blouse closes right over left,
        confer "Un léger chevauchement droite sur gauche est présent à la base du col en V".
    the printed cotton shirt-blouse has a collar,
        confer "d'un col rond avec une ouverture partielle en V au niveau du décolleté".
    the printed cotton shirt-blouse contains 100 percent of cotton.
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the printed cotton shirt-blouse is 6106.10"].

% BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2025-07379, French customs, 03/07/2026: unisex children's knitted lace blouse.
scenario bti_frbtifr_bti_2025_07379 is, as stated in BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2025-07379:
    the lace blouse is an upper body garment,
        confer "Description of goods Vêtement destiné à couvrir le haut du corps".
    the lace blouse is classified under the EU tariff,
        confer "Issuing country FR".
    the fabric construction of the lace blouse is knitted,
        confer "confectionnée en étoffe de bonneterie de fibres synthétiques imitant la dentelle (92 % polyamide".
    the lace blouse has an opening starting at the neckline,
        confer "Le vêtement est doté d'une encolure ronde avec une ouverture partielle dans le dos".
    the lace blouse contains 92 percent of polyamide,
        confer "synthétiques imitant la dentelle (92 % polyamide".
    the lace blouse contains 8 percent of elastane,
        confer "8% élasthanne)".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the lace blouse is 6106.20"].

