    the hooded sweatshirt is an upper body garment,
        confer "Description of goods Vêtement destiné à recouvrir la partie supérieure du corps".
    the hooded sweatshirt is classified under the EU tariff,
        confer "Issuing country FR".
    the fabric construction of the hooded sweatshirt is knitted,
        confer "confectionné en bonneterie de jersey de coton majoritairement (70%) et en polyester (30%)".
    the hooded sweatshirt is of plain knit fabric,
        confer "confectionné en bonneterie de jersey de coton majoritairement (70%) et en polyester (30%)".
    the hooded sweatshirt has a means of tightening at the bottom,
        confer "et des bords-côtes aux manches et à la base du vêtement".
    the hooded sweatshirt contains 70 percent of cotton,
        confer "de coton majoritairement (70%) et en polyester (30%)".
    the hooded sweatshirt contains 30 percent of polyester,
        confer "majoritairement (70%) et en polyester (30%)".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the hooded sweatshirt is 6110.20"].

% BTI DEBTI22717/26-1, Hauptzollamt Hannover, 28/07/2026: lightweight under-pullover.
