    the mesh under-pullover is an upper body garment,
        confer "Pullover (Unterziehpulli)".
    the mesh under-pullover is classified under the EU tariff,
        confer "Issuing country DE".
    the fabric construction of the mesh under-pullover is knitted,
        confer "netzartig durchbrochen gearbeiteten Gewirken aus laut Antrag 86 % Polyester und 14 % Elasthan (synthetische".
    the fabric of the mesh under-pullover is lightweight,
        confer "﻿4 mm (leichten) dicken".
    the mesh under-pullover has a high neckline,
        confer "hohen Kragen (somit kein Kleidungsstück der Position 6109)".
    the mesh under-pullover has a collar,
        confer "hohen Kragen (somit kein Kleidungsstück der Position 6109)".
    the mesh under-pullover contains 86 percent of polyester,
        confer "Gewirken aus laut Antrag 86 % Polyester und 14 % Elasthan (synthetische Chemiefasern)".
    the mesh under-pullover contains 14 percent of elastane,
        confer "Antrag 86 % Polyester und 14 % Elasthan (synthetische Chemiefasern)".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the mesh under-pullover is 6110.30"].

% BTI DEBTI17890/26-1, Hauptzollamt Hannover, 14/07/2026: shirt of a two-piece shirt and trousers set.
scenario bti_debti17890_26_1 is, as stated in BTI DEBTI17890/26-1:
    the embroidered cotton shirt is an upper body garment,
        confer "Description of goods Hemd und lange Hose".
    the embroidered cotton shirt is classified under the EU tariff,
        confer "Issuing country DE".
    the fabric construction of the embroidered cotton shirt is woven,
        confer "buntgewebten Geweben aus laut Antrag 100 % Baumwolle".
    the embroidered cotton shirt closes left over right,
        confer "vorn mit einer durchgehenden Öffnung mit Knopfverschluss von links auf rechts (Männer- kleidung)".
    the embroidered cotton shirt has a collar,
        confer "mit einem Reverskragen".
    the embroidered cotton shirt has an opening starting at the neckline,
        confer "vorn mit einer durchgehenden Öffnung mit Knopfverschluss von links auf rechts (Männer- kleidung)".
    the embroidered cotton shirt contains 100 percent of cotton,
        confer "buntgewebten Geweben aus laut Antrag 100 % Baumwolle".
    the embroidered cotton shirt is claimed to belong to sleepwear,
        confer "Keywords NOT EXCLUSIVELY SLEEPWEAR".
    the claim that the embroidered cotton shirt belongs to sleepwear is rejected,
        according to Hauptzollamt Hannover, confer "kein Schlafanzug".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the embroidered cotton shirt is 6205.20"].

% BTI DEBTI9846/26-1, Hauptzollamt Hannover, 05/06/2026: women's woven blouse.
scenario bti_debti9846_26_1 is, as stated in BTI DEBTI9846/26-1:
    % DISAGREES: Hauptzollamt Hannover gives 6206.30; the model gives no heading — the office finds the garment 'presents itself as a blouse' (the CN Explanatory Note: light, fancy, mostly loose-fitting) but records no loose fit, and sleeveless it is no shirt.
    the sleeveless flounced blouse is an upper body garment,
        confer "Description of goods Bluse".
    the sleeveless flounced blouse is classified under the EU tariff,
        confer "Issuing country DE".
    the fabric construction of the sleeveless flounced blouse is woven,
        confer "buntgewebten Geweben aus augenscheinlich Garnen aus Baumwolle (überwiegend)".
    the cut of the sleeveless flounced blouse indicates women,
        confer "somit erkennbar Frauenkleidung".
    the sleeveless flounced blouse is sleeveless,
        confer "ärmellos".
    the sleeveless flounced blouse has an opening starting at the neckline,
        confer "16 cm nach unten reichenden Öffnung".
    the fabric of the sleeveless flounced blouse is lightweight,
        confer "überwiegend leicht gefüttert".
    the textile material of the sleeveless flounced blouse is cotton,
        according to Hauptzollamt Hannover, confer "Geweben aus augenscheinlich Garnen aus Baumwolle (überwiegend) und Spinnstoffgarnen in Verbindung mit laut Antrag",
        because "the yarns are of cotton, which predominates, and of textile yarn combined with metal (metalized yarn of heading 5605); the BTI gives no percentages".
    subheading expects answers [].
    unplaced expects answers ["the sleeveless flounced blouse is not placed by the model"].

% BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2025-07180, French customs, 28/07/2026: women's satin blouse with thin straps.
scenario bti_frbtifr_bti_2025_07180 is, as stated in BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2025-07180:
    % DISAGREES: French customs gives 6206.40; the model gives no heading — the office applies the CN Explanatory Note to heading 6206 (light fancy garments, mostly loose-fitting, at least with straps) but records no loose fit.
    the red satin strap blouse is an upper body garment,
        confer "Description of goods Vêtement destiné à couvrir la partie haute du corps".
    the red satin strap blouse is classified under the EU tariff,
        confer "Issuing country FR".
    the fabric construction of the red satin strap blouse is woven,
        confer "confectionné en matière textile satinée de tissu de fibres synthétiques majoritaires (80 % polyester)".
    the cut of the red satin strap blouse indicates women,
        confer "de type blouse pour femmes de couleur rouge".
    the red satin strap blouse is sleeveless,
        confer "Cette blouse est dotée de bretelles fines".
    the red satin strap blouse has shoulder straps,
        confer "Cette blouse est dotée de bretelles fines".
    the red satin strap blouse contains 80 percent of polyester,
        confer "synthétiques majoritaires (80 % polyester)".
    the red satin strap blouse contains 19 percent of viscose,
        confer "de fibres artificielles (19 % viscose) et de fibres synthétiques (1 % élasthanne)".
    the red satin strap blouse contains 1 percent of elastane,
        confer "de fibres synthétiques (1 % élasthanne)".
    subheading expects answers [].
    unplaced expects answers ["the red satin strap blouse is not placed by the model"].
